<div class="kapi-error" data-kapi-preset="checklist" role="alert" data-kapi-id="l0000005"><span class="kapi-error-tag">&lt;kapi-checklist&gt;</span> holds only &lt;kapi-task&gt; children, not &lt;li&gt;</div>
